[{"title":"秋日小病同心石师强至山寺","author":"宗乘","text":"寺门秋竹冷烟扉，石路欹斜在翠微。\n领略心情忘我病，寂寥光景见人稀。\n欲题古壁花生眼，久坐荒苔藓透衣。\n应笑学空多岁月，个中还挂往来机。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":686,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"发皋亭","author":"宗乘","text":"晓发凌苍苔，徘徊谷中步。\n松门磬已微，空翠惊相顾。\n涧声杂幽禽，岩花落深树。\n孤怀当何如，复此春向暮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":687,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月下树影同石城赋","author":"宗乘","text":"了不异真树，枝枝生自空。\n下檐云转影，摇壁野过风。\n淡极如烟外，欹多似水中。\n闲人古来少，心喻幸君同。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":688,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁卯岁归仰天坞故山 其一","author":"海岱","text":"松小已逾岭，不归应偶然。\n久窥飞鸟意，难定白云天。\n夜磬答孤语，秋花照短眠。\n清光纷委壑，寒重草堂前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":689,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"丁卯岁归仰天坞故山 其二","author":"海岱","text":"萍逢江汉上，曾似此林居。\n引水涵云窦，编花护草庐。\n雨香孤径竹，风冷半畦蔬。\n曾侍山中石，还开案上书。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":690,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"月夜送弱翁","author":"实印","text":"山客复何去，柴门故夜开。\n月寒醒鸟梦，松影误溪苔。\n水上孤舟解，林端一磬来。\n知君非远别，相送亦徘徊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":691,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"同诜兮过竹忘斋中","author":"实印","text":"钟声如一寺，林影望还分。\n径转塔才见，轩开溪共闻。\n相过成晚步，分坐见秋云。\n诗卷娱禅暇，晴窗花气熏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":692,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雨歇","author":"妙严","text":"林畔低烟豁，斜光草露轻。\n虚窗停薄暑，独坐拥馀清。\n云去渐无影，泉多自有声。\n起看江上夜，新月白微生。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":693,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"新寒","author":"妙严","text":"露气逼衾枕，早窗寒已生。\n客心惊岁晚，物色过秋清。\n群木连朝脱，空山竟日睛。\n宵砧方未歇，处处寄衣情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":694,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"偶题竹上","author":"源际","text":"冷翠何冥密，幽寻独坐时。\n扉开流水过，风静到云迟。\n懒性知终弃，虚心幸自持。\n偶然吟未稳，清响动高枝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":695,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"雪夜","author":"通洽","text":"雪光窗外寒如月，梅影灯前韵过僧。\n坐到更残群响尽，细吹榾柮煮春冰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":696,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"山居","author":"如晓","text":"挂钵初为客，岩前别是春。\n梅残窗影乱，草发砌痕新。\n日出偶无事，云来如有人。\n长歌深竹里，不记住山贫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":697,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"遣句","author":"如晓","text":"倚杖看松残雪后，荷锄移竹小春前。\n较多白发浑闲事，得住青山又一年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":698,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄兄","author":"沈琼莲","text":"疏明星斗夜阑珊，玉貌花容列女官。\n风递凤凰天乐近，雪残鳷鹊晓楼寒。\n昭仪引驾临丹扆，尚寝薰炉爇紫檀。\n肃肃六宫悬象魏，春风前殿想鸣鸾。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":699,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送弟溥试春官","author":"沈琼莲","text":"少小离家侍禁闱，人间天上两依稀。\n朝迎凤辇趋青琐，夕捧鸾书入紫薇。\n银烛烧残空有梦，玉钗敲断未成归。\n年年望汝登金籍，同补山龙上衮衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":700,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其一","author":"沈琼莲","text":"尚仪引见近龙床，御笔亲题墨色香。\n幸得唱名居第一，沐恩舞蹈谢君王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":701,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其二","author":"沈琼莲","text":"翠丝蟠袖紫罗襦，偷把黄金小带舒。\n中使传宣光禄宴，内家学士作新除。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":702,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其四","author":"沈琼莲","text":"倦把青绒绣紫纱，阁针时复卜灯花。\n明朝太后长生诞，可有恩波遍及么。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":703,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其五","author":"沈琼莲","text":"豆蔻花封小字缄，寄声千里落云帆。\n一春从不寻芳去，高叠香罗旧赐衫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":704,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其六","author":"沈琼莲","text":"天子龙楼瞥见妆，芙蓉团殿试罗裳。\n水风凉好朝西坐，专把书经教小王。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":705,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其七","author":"沈琼莲","text":"晓临鸾镜整梳妆，高髻新兴一尺长。\n花影琐窗人下直，开笼自放雪衣娘。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":706,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其八","author":"沈琼莲","text":"明窗棐几净炉薰，闲阅仙书小篆文。\n昼永帘垂春寂寂，碧桃花映石榴裙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":707,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其九","author":"沈琼莲","text":"海东青放渡辽烟，天上群鹅得自专。\n敕谕鹰坊高索价，圣王廿载绝游畋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":708,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宫词 其十","author":"沈琼莲","text":"御柳青青燕子愁，万条齐水弄春柔。\n东风不与闲人赠，谁去江南水上洲。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":709,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题蓟州汤泉","author":"王妃","text":"塞外风霜冻异常，水池何事旷如汤。\n溶溶一脉流今古，不为人间洗冷肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":710,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题蓟州汤泉","author":"王庄妃","text":"闷倚雕栏强笑歌，娇姿无力怯宫罗。\n欲将旧恨题红叶，只恐新愁上翠蛾。\n雨过玉阶天色净，风吹金锁夜声多。\n从来不识君王面，弃置无情奈若何。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":711,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题蓟州汤泉","author":"媚兰","text":"寒气逼人眠不得，钟声催月下斜廊。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":712,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柳眼","author":"安福郡主","text":"一段风流态，青青独可亲。\n沿堤看去客，融水望归人。\n滴露如虫泣，含烟似頞颦。\n半开还半合，窥尽满江春。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":713,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"立秋","author":"夏云英","text":"秋风吹雨过南楼，一夜新凉是立秋。\n宝鸭香消沉火冷，侍儿闲自理空侯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":714,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"秋夜即事","author":"夏云英","text":"西风飒飒动罗帏，初夜焚香下玉墀。\n礼罢真如庭院静，银缸高照看围棋。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":715,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"题邮亭壁歌","author":"宋金华","text":"邮亭咫尺堪投宿，手握亲姑憩茅屋。\n抱薪就地旋铺摊，支颐相向吞声哭。\n旁人问我是何方，俯首哀哀诉衷曲。\n妾家祖居金华府，海道曾为上千户。\n举艘运粟大都回，金牌敕赐双飞虎。\n兄弟晦迹隐山林，甘学崇文不崇武。\n今朝玉堂宋学士，亦与妾家同一谱。\n笄年嫁向衢州城，夫婿好学明《诗经》。\n《离骚》子史遍搜揽，志欲出仕苏苍生。\n前春郡邑忽交辟，辞亲千里趋神京。\n丹墀对策中殿举，驰书归报泥金名。\n承恩拜除阆州守，飘然画舫西南行。\n到官未几访遗老，要把奸顽尽除扫。\n日则升堂治公务，夜则挑灯理文稿。\n守廉不使纤尘污，执法致遭僚佐怒。\n府推获罪苦相攀，察院来提有谁诉。\n临行囊橐无锱铢，惟有旧日将去书。\n城中父老泣相送，道傍过者咸嗟吁。\n一时征赃动盈万，妾夫自料无从办。\n经旬苦打不成招，暗嘱家人莫送饭。\n嗟乎饿死囹圄中，旗军原籍来抄封。\n当时指望耀门户，岂期一旦翻成空。\n亲邻怜妾贫如洗，敛钞殷勤馈行李。\n伶仃三口到京师，奉旨编军戍金齿。\n阿弟远送龙江边，临歧抱头哭向天。\n姊南弟北两相痛，别后再会知何年。\n开船未远子病倒，求医问卜皆难保。\n武昌城外野坡前，白骨谁怜葬青草。\n初然有子相依傍，身安且不忧家荡。\n如今子死姑年高，纵到云南有谁望。\n八月官船渡常德，促装登途整行色。\n空林日暮鹧鸪啼，声声叫到行不得。\n上山险如登天梯，百户发放来取齐。\n雨晴泥滑把姑手，一步一仆身沾泥。\n晚来走向营中宿，神思昏昏倦无力。\n五更睡重起身迟，饭锅未熟旗头逼。\n翻思昔日深闺内，远行不出中门外。\n融融日影上栏干，花落庭前鸟声碎。\n宝髻斜簪金凤翘，翠云蝉鬓娥眉娇。\n绣床新刺双蛱蝶，坐久尚怯春风饶。\n岂知一旦夫亡后，万里遐荒要亲走。\n半途日暮姑云饥，欲丐奉姑羞举口。\n同来一妇天台人，情怀薄似秋空云。\n丧夫未经二十日，画眉重嫁盐商君。\n血色红裙绣罗袄，终日骑驴涉长道。\n稳坐不知行路难，扬鞭笑指青山小。\n取欢但感新人心，那忆旧夫恩爱深。\n吁嗟风俗日颓败，废尽大义贪黄金。\n妾心汪汪淡如水，宁受饥寒不受耻。\n几回欲葬江鱼腹，姑存未敢先求死。\n前途姑身少康健，辛苦奉姑终不怨。\n姑亡妾亦随姑亡，地下何惭见夫面。\n说罢伤心泪如雨，咽咽垂头不成语。\n路傍过者为酸心，隔岭孤猿叫何许。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":716,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"武定桥烈妇诗","author":"武定桥烈妇","text":"不忍将身配象奴，手提麦饭祭亡夫。\n今朝武定桥头死，要使清风满帝都。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":717,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"述怀","author":"钱氏女","text":"静守深闺岁屡迁，蕙心兰质自娟娟。\n援琴不奏桑间曲，挥翰宁题叶上联。\n龟灼已知无吉兆，鹊桥那得有良缘。\n芙蓉只合含霜死，肯向西风怨暮年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":718,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"鹭鸶小景","author":"邹赛贞","text":"联拳属玉儿，飞向矶头立。\n秋寒雪不消，点破江天碧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":719,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"闻征瓦氏兵至","author":"杨文俪","text":"绣门旗下陈如云，万里提兵净寇氛。\n多少材官屯海畔，策勋翻仗女将军。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":720,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日旅馆偶成","author":"金文贞","text":"陌上原头杨柳纤，东风消息在江南。\n故园门径曾栽五，明日时光更起三。\n春盛杜鹃空自怨，枝深鹦鹉许谁谈。\n昼长公馆清如水，坐听鸣琴久欲酣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":721,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日送大卿君赴任武冈","author":"金文贞","text":"麦秋春去客程初，远逐湖南万里馀。\n人静夜鹃啼有韵，道偏秋雁泪无书。\n檐蛛网就丝难尽，梅豆丸成苦未除。\n伯乐自来何处觅，错将良骥驾盐车。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":722,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"宦邸寒食","author":"金文贞","text":"细细催花雨若丝，异乡寒食故乡思。\n采蘋士女榆烟暮，斗草儿童杏酪迟。\n两岸绿杨当古道，一群白鹭点晴漪。\n东风昨夜还家梦，泣向先姑酌酒卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":723,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登江楼","author":"韩安人屈氏","text":"登高楼兮，见西风吹水之潺湲。\n水东去以不回兮，客思归其何年！","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":724,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送夫入觐","author":"韩安人屈氏","text":"君往燕山去，弃妾雒水旁。\n雒水向东流，妾魂随飞扬。\n丈夫轻离别，壮志在四方。\n努力事明主，肯为儿女伤。\n君有双亲老，垂白坐高堂。\n晨昏妾定省，喜惧君自量。\n珍重复珍重，叮咛须记将。\n既为远别去，饮馀手中觞。\n莫辞手中觞，为君整行装。\n阳关歌欲断，柳条丝更长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":725,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"述怀","author":"韩安人屈氏","text":"淅淅北风起，萧萧木叶稀。\n寒花愁更发，鸿雁独南飞。\n秋老商山里，天长渭水西。\n思归归未得，怅望泪沾衣。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":726,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄夫","author":"杨安人黄氏","text":"雁飞曾不到衡阳，锦字何由寄永昌。\n三春花柳妾薄命，六诏风烟君断肠。\n曰归曰归愁岁暮，其雨其雨怨朝阳。\n相闻空有刀环约，何日金鸡下夜郎？","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":727,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"绝句","author":"杨安人黄氏","text":"才经赏月时，又度菊花期。\n岁月东流水，人生远别离。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":728,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄升庵调黄莺儿","author":"杨安人黄氏","text":"晴雨酿春寒，见繁花树树，残泥涂满眼。\n登临倦，江流几湾？\n云山几盘？\n天涯极目空肠断，寄书难。\n无情征雁，飞不到滇南。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":729,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"戏赠小姑","author":"储氏","text":"夭桃灼灼向窗前，十二阑干次第看。\n昨夜雨声三四点，惜花人听未曾眠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":730,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"苦雨","author":"马间卿","text":"终日雨翻盆，愁人欲断魂。\n岭云生屋角，野水没篱根。\n杨柳深藏径，梨花静掩门。\n声声偏入耳，寂寞自朝昏。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":731,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮秋","author":"马间卿","text":"野色满园中，闲情立晚风。\n菊花舍雨艳，枫叶醉霜红。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":732,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"暮春","author":"马间卿","text":"纱窗睡起蔼朝晖，满院莺声花正飞。\n闲里不知因甚事，春来容易送春归。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":733,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"七夕","author":"马间卿","text":"灵鹊成桥事有无，人间今夜忆黄姑。\n倚窗坐久秋声动，一叶西风到碧梧。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":734,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"泊淮代外答唐太史","author":"陈恭人董氏","text":"十年生事半同君，万里伤心逐楚云。\n远浦维舟潮欲上，平林对酒月初分。\n逢人牛马时堪应，到处凫鸥渐作群。\n共是机情忘已尽，欲将通塞任斯文。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":735,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"冬夜","author":"毛钰龙","text":"玉井无声户已扃，一庭霜月冷如凝。\n谁怜寂寞书窗下，冻影梅花伴夜灯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":736,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"故城过父友李公旧居","author":"于太夫人刘氏","text":"暮云深锁故城春，绿树苍烟旧白蘋。\n昔日高楼双燕子，定巢无处往来频。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":737,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春","author":"端淑卿","text":"院外莺啼二月中，妆台日影映帘栊。\n润回野草茸茸绿，暖入琼枝簇簇红。\n乍试轻罗沾社雨，偶尝新酿醉东风。\n闲来点检芳时事，花底青丝坠小虫。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":738,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"隋柳","author":"端淑卿","text":"炀帝堤边柳，凋零几度秋。\n蝉声悲故国，莺语怨荒丘。\n行殿基何在，空江水自流。\n行人休折尽，折尽更生愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":739,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"读岳武穆王传","author":"邓铃","text":"英雄誓复旧山河，曾奈奸邪误国何。\n铁马长驱河洛水，金牌亟返郾城戈。\n中原父老空遮诉，南渡君臣不耻和。\n五国城头烟月惨，千年坟树尽南柯。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":740,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"先翁捐世姑氏继没哀挽","author":"邓铃","text":"自昔诸孤仰母慈，萱花零落最堪悲。\n衣中忍看缝时线，机上空馀断后丝。\n千载松楸嗟已老，九原霜露不胜思。\n悬知几度伤心处，正是乌啼月落时。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":741,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆娃宫次韵命二女同作","author":"王凤娴","text":"香径有基惟鸟迹，屟廊无主剩苔厓。\n花钱旋舞留金靥，蜗宇纵横见玉钗。\n颓榭草深归燕绕，故宫月冷野狐埋。\n西风禾黍斜阳道，过此行人合怆怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":742,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆娃宫次韵","author":"张引元","text":"繁华事散惟荒土，麋鹿踪消只藓厓。\n皓月尚疑悬玉镜，露桃犹似妒金钗。\n蛾眉一瞬歌尘散，鱼腹千年侠骨埋。\n今日姑苏重回首，岭云江水不胜怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":743,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"馆娃宫次韵","author":"张引庆","text":"禾黍已蒙香径土，苏台还恨锁苍厓。\n云归叠叠堆鸦鬓，花落纷纷掷燕钗。\n此日锦笙惟岛弄，当年雄剑自尘埋。\n荒原古柏西风里，漫对吴山独怆怀。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":744,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"燕子楼","author":"王凤娴","text":"燕子楼头燕子回，何年鹤去见归来。\n相思怨结东风泪，洒向残花已剩灰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":745,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和母燕子楼诗","author":"张引元","text":"人自伤心春自回，倚阑愁睹燕归来。\n玉箫吹断秦楼曲，嬴得红颜镜里灰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":746,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"和母燕子楼诗","author":"张引庆","text":"雒阳三月雨如烟，添得离人思黯然。\n惆怅秦楼分凤侣，清灯寒月自年年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":747,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悲感二女遗物 其一 空闺","author":"王凤娴","text":"壁网蛛丝镜网尘，花钿委地不知春。\n伤心怕见呢喃燕，犹在雕梁觅主人。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":748,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悲感二女遗物 其二 闲针","author":"王凤娴","text":"少年工制独称奇，绝似灵芸夜绣时。\n笑语楼前争乞巧，伤心无复见穿丝。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":749,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悲感二女遗物 其三 剩粉","author":"王凤娴","text":"晓妆曾整傅铅华，玉匣新开斗雪花。\n今日可怜俱委落，馀香犹自锁窗纱。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":750,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"悲感二女遗物 其四 废线","author":"王凤娴","text":"柳絮风沉恨渺茫，断肠丝缕在空箱。\n孤帏老我愁如织，谁记初阳报日长。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":751,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"寄妹","author":"张引元","text":"金风初度井梧枝，正是怀人病起迟。\n两地离愁悬一镜，九秋新恨上双眉。\n久虚咏雪联芳句，每忆挑灯共课时。\n塞雁已归书未达，江城寒月照相思。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_4.csv","pointer":752,"sha256":"d4c6bdc86d2bd9fcbfe4f5f3e747aedf1814e37aaa1f3848834d8e9316029b79","dynasty":"明"}}]